{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25108","headline":"荅边信 · 长孙佐辅","name":"荅边信","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"征人去年戍辽水，夜得边书字盈纸。\n挥刀就烛裁红绮，结作同心荅千里。\n君寄边书书莫绝，妾荅同心心自结。\n同心再解心不离，书字频看字愁灭。\n结成一夜和泪封，贮书只在怀袖中。\n莫如书字故难久，愿学同心长可同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"长孙佐辅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25108.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25108","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}